+Name: LiteRT-LM
+Short Name: litert_lm
+URL: https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM
+Version: 0.18.0
+Revision: v0.18.0
+Update Mechanism: Manual
+License: Apache-2.0
+License File: src/LICENSE
+Security Critical: Yes
+Shipped: no
+
+Description:
+LiteRT-LM runs large language models such as Gemma 4 on device. Chrome for iOS
+uses its Swift API and the prebuilt CLiteRTLM.framework of the same release to
+back the built-in AI APIs with Gemma 4 where Apple Foundation Models are not
+available.
+
+`fetch.py` downloads both. Neither is checked in.
+
+Local Modifications:
+None
